{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017081148973-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017091020\"/><p>報稱受傷女事主。(馬竟峯攝)</p><p>土瓜灣發生傷人盜竊案。今日(17日)早上7時05分，一名女子報案，指在永耀街3號唐樓一單位內因故與5至6名男女友人發生爭執，期間遭人用鐵錘襲擊，並被掠去3000元現金。救護車接報到場將報稱手腳受傷事主送院治理。人員登樓調查，翻查梯間閉路電視片段，了解事發經過。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T01:19:16.599285+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T00:11:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:17:43.598519+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T01:17:47.484414+00:00","content_hash":"c62b00ae7401be80b102b282322c5b994f4d191d0deb81009ca9bf2d40d13695","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}